  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce mild italian sausage",
    "300 gram cauliflower",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/4 cup chicken stock",
    "1 medium lime",
    "1/4 cup fresh cilantro",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Over medium to high heat, add water to a skillet and bring to a boil. Add the sausages. Cover the skillet with a lid and let the sausages cook. Turn them to cook both sides every so often. Remove lid and let the sausages finish cooking, still turning every so often.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from skillet and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same skillet, add the olive oil and minced garlic. Fry until fragrant.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cauliflower rice. Stir well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the chicken stock to the skillet and stir well to combine. Let this simmer for 2 - 3 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cilantro to the skillet and stir well to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the Italian sausages back into the pan and slice them up into bite sized pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sausage-and-Cilantro-Lime-Rice-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Squeeze the lime juice over the sausage and rice. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-and-cilantro-lime-rice/#wprm-recipe-53953-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
